### Sale Module Tests
### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@salePath = /sale

POST {{baseUrl}}{{salePath}}/record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productID": 6,
  "quantitySold": 2,
  "saleDate": "2025-05-20"
}


